<title>GREECE: Table of Greek mutual fund flows, assets.</title>
<headline>Table of Greek mutual fund flows, assets.</headline>
<dateline>ATHENS 1997-05-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Ionian Bank reported the following daily and year-to-date changes in the volume of Greek mutual fund outstanding shares, net assets and net share prices, as well as total net asset sizes as of May 27.</p>
<p>				    May 27/May 26   May 27/Dec 31, 96</p>
<p>						 (%)		  (%)</p>
<p>NET SHARE PRICES*</p>
<p>  Total market			    0.00		 6.84</p>
<p>  Fixed income &amp;money market funds  0.03		 4.95</p>
<p>  International funds		   0.24		 9.65</p>
<p>  Growth Funds			   -0.60		60.28</p>
<p>* Prices include distributed dividends</p>
<p>VOLUME OF SHARES</p>
